But you never fight on the front
line, so who are you to talk?

5
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:14,659
You don't need to use any crystals.

6
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:15,957
Of course I do.

7
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:18,477
You're the popular one
around here, Silica.

8
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:21,501
